**After** (1 request):
```typescript
const response = await api.customer.home({ city, latitude, longitude });
setFeaturedShop(response.featured?.[0] || null);
setTopRatedShops(response.top_rated || []);
setNearestShops(response.near_you || []);
setOpenNowShops(response.open_now || []);
setCashbackShops(response.cashback || []);
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **No fallback to 4 old requests in production.** On failure → graceful empty state (already handled by `HomeEmptyState` component).

