## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 1. **Auth requirement**: Should `GET /customer/home` require authentication? Currently the whole `CustomerController` requires `CUSTOMER` role. The `/barbershops` list endpoint is also auth-guarded. Keeping auth seems correct.
> 
> 2. **`near_you` without coordinates**: If the customer app doesn't pass `latitude/longitude`, should `near_you` section be empty or fall back to `relevance_score` sort?
> 
> 3. **`business_type` filter**: Should it apply to ALL sections or only some? E.g., featured might want to show all types regardless.

